<title>USA: American Electromedics names new chairman.</title>
<headline>American Electromedics names new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>AMHERST, N.H. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Electromedics Corp said Monday it named Thomas Slamecka as chairman of its board of directors.</p>
<p>Slamecka, who was formerly president of poultry company ConAgra Poultry Co, will assume his new post immediately, it said.  </p>
<p>A company official said chairman of the board was a new position at American Electromedics, which makes diagnostic medical devices.</p>
</text>
